invariant: INV-16
file: widemul.h
catches: widemul_runtime_test
reason: widemul_x25519_base runs the wide field's key generation, with its
  table and its 64x64->128 products, for every answer, so a session whose
  caller stated nothing about the multiply runs it. Every byte still comes
  out the same. bin/widemul_runtime_test counts the calls into each copy
  and requires the 16-word field alone without the constant-time answer.

--- old
    if (widemul_native(widemul)) {
        x25519_wide_base(out, scalar);
--- new
    if (widemul_native(widemul) || 1) {
        x25519_wide_base(out, scalar);
